type: diagnosis
title: External delivery raced a provisional Claude session identity
description: Celly's repeated over-window compaction attempts were caused by external channel messages arriving before the published socket session was confirmed by a routed request.
tags: [celly, compaction, sse, session-identity, admission]
timestamp: 2026-10-22
status: fixed-source-and-installed
